// A call through a variable of function type. The variable is a C function
// pointer under its own name, and C calls one as it calls a function; the
// pointer's type carries the prototype, so each argument converts to its
// parameter's type exactly as it would at a call to id_NAME.
// The strict fingerprint pass and then the import-duplicate table over an
// empty prog, for the import-duplicate scan's own "nothing to compare" cases.
lz_empty() {
  fwd_env();
  uq_fill();
  imd_fill();
} return void;
